==Icelandic==
{{Icelandic declension kk sb vetur|vet|ur}}
===Etymology===
From {{ON.|is}} ''[[vetr]]'' (‘winter, year’).

===Noun===
'''vetur''' {{m}} ([[vetrar|vet-rar]], [[vetur|vetur-]])

# [[winter]], [[wintertime]]
#: '''''Veturinn''' er í [[nánd]]'' 
#:: '''Winter''' is close.
# [[year]], [[age]]
#: ''Barnið er fimm '''vetra''' gamalt.''
#:: The child is five '''years''' old.

====Derived terms====
*[[í vetur]] (this winter)
*[[á veturna]]/[[á vetrin]] (in [[winter]], in the winter)
*[[í vetur sem leið]] (last winter)

